75/Insta-Followers-Bot","stars":4,"forks":2,"watchers":0,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":"In this script, the Bot will follow, like and comment on the photos displayed in the search results of certain Hashtags. In turn, many users whose photos have been liked, commented by us and whose profiles have been followed by the bot will follow us back in most cases. ","topics":[],"score":287197,"global_rank":29449,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6312},{"name":"SaloniDash7/McCulloch-Pitts-Animation","owner":"SaloniDash7","html_url":"https://github.com/SaloniDash7/McCulloch-Pitts-Animation","stars":4,"forks":2,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Python animation illustrating the McCulloch Pitts model of the neuron","topics":[],"score":287169,"global_rank":29461,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6313},{"name":"lordlosslyy/Semantic-Segmentation-CNN-for-India-Driving-Dataset","owner":"lordlosslyy","html_url":"https://github.com/lordlosslyy/Semantic-Segmentation-CNN-for-India-Driving-Dataset","stars":5,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"We use deep convolutional neural networks to experiment semantic segmentation task on India Driving Dataset. We use pixel accuracy and Intersection-Over-Union as the evaluation metrics and experiment different kinds of methods, including weighted loss, data augmentation, transfer learning, and U-Net architecture. Weighted loss method achieved 61.07% average IoU and data augmentation method with rotated and cropped images achieved 63.73% IoU. However, it largely increases the training time. Using the transfer learning VGG, we achieve 73.74% average pixel accuracy and 58.45% average IoU on the test set. In addition, we achieve 78.03% average test pixel accuracy and 64.04% average test IoU by the method of U-Net. Finally, we build a new model named Mobile-Deeplabv3+, and we achieved 83.56% average pixel accuracy and 71.35% average IoU on the test set.","